<title>HUNGARY: BUDAPEST BOURSE DELETES MARTFU.</title>
<headline>BUDAPEST BOURSE DELETES MARTFU.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange said on Tuesday it would delete the shares of brewery company Elso Magyar Szovetkezeti Sorgyar Rt (Martfu) as of today.</p>
<p>The bourse's step follows an approval by shareholders of Martfu and of other brewery Soproni Sorgyar Rt - both majority owned by Austria's Brau Union AG - to merge Martfu into Soproni. The merge was effective on April 30.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
